        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">Physiological functions of body structures (zang-fu organs, meridians, body constituents, sense orifices, qi-blood-fluids) as described in the theoretical system of TCM.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>中医学生理功能是中医学理论体系所阐述的人体结构（脏腑、经络、形体、官窍、气血津液）功能活动的统称。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">中医学生理功能</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">中医学生理功能</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


