        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">支气管树</rdfs:label>
        <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma7365"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0001507 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0001507">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0001505"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/hasFMAName"/>
                <owl:hasValue>Septal leaflet of tricuspid valve</owl:hasValue>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>由单层上皮细胞构成的半球状囊泡。肺中的支气管经多次反复分枝成无数细支气管，它们的末端膨大成囊，囊的四周有很多突出的小囊泡，即为肺泡。肺泡的大小形状不一，平均直径0.2毫米。成人约有3～4亿个肺泡，总面积近100平方米，比人的皮肤的表面积还要大好几倍。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA5772</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Alveoli</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>肺泡</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/1637303052</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID>7240</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Pulmonary alveoli</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">肺泡</rdfs:label>
        <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma7240"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0001508 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0001508">
