        <ns6:hasICD11Name>- - - 体被系统</ns6:hasICD11Name>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Integumentary system</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>体被系统</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
