        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003399"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>会阴穴在会阴部，男性当阴囊根部与肛门连线的中点。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Perineum</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">会阴</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003401 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003401">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_TO_0000031"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">TCM body structure: the totality of human morphological structures as conceptualized in TCM theory, comprising zang-fu organs, meridians, body constituents, sense orifices and fundamental substances such as qi, blood and body fluids.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>中医身体结构是中医学理论体系所认识的人体形态结构的统称，包括脏腑、经络、形体、官窍以及气血津液等基本物质。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">中医身体结构</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">中医身体结构</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003402 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003402">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003401"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">The five body constituents in TCM—sinews, vessels, muscles, skin and bones—each corresponding to one of the five zang organs (liver, heart, spleen, lung, kidney).</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>五体是中医学对筋、脉、肉（肌肉）、皮、骨五种形体组织的统称，分别与肝、心、脾、肺、肾五脏相合。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Five Body Parts</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">五体</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://ihtsdo.org/snomedct/anatomy#69548008"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003407 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003407">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003401"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">The nine orifices in TCM: the seven orifices of the head (eyes, ears, nostrils and mouth) plus the anterior and posterior yin orifices, serving as portals between the zang-fu essence-qi and the exterior.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>九窍是中医学对头部七窍（两目、两耳、两鼻孔、口）与前阴、后阴二窍的统称，为脏腑精气与外界相通的门户。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Nine Orifices</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">九窍</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://ihtsdo.org/snomedct/anatomy#311396006"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003408 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003408">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000577"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/hasFMAName"/>
                <owl:hasValue>Eye</owl:hasValue>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">The orbital cavity: the bony socket housing the eyeball and its adnexa.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>眼窝是容纳眼球及其附属结构的骨性腔隙，即眼眶。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA7D89</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Eye</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>眼</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/2055915829</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID>54448</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Eye socket</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">眼窝</rdfs:label>
        <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma54448"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000628 -->

    
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003410 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003410">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000577"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/hasFMAName"/>
                <owl:hasValue>Eye</owl:hasValue>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">Baijing (white of the eye): in the five-wheel theory, the visible white part of the eye corresponding to the bulbar conjunctiva and sclera, belonging to the qi wheel and related to the lung.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>白眼是中医五轮学说中眼球可见的白色部分，相当于球结膜与巩膜，属气轮，内应于肺。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA7D89</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Eye</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>眼</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/2055915829</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID>54448</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">White of the eye (baijing)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">白眼</rdfs:label>
        <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma54448"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003411 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003411">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000577"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/hasFMAName"/>
                <owl:hasValue>Eye</owl:hasValue>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">Heijing (black of the eye): in the five-wheel theory, the dark anterior part of the eye corresponding to the cornea and iris, belonging to the wind wheel and related to the liver.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>黑眼是中医五轮学说中眼球前部呈黑色的部分，相当于角膜与虹膜，属风轮，内应于肝。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA7D89</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Eye</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>眼</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/2055915829</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID>54448</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Black of the eye (heijing)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">黑眼</rdfs:label>
        <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma54448"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003412 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003412">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000577"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">Tongzi: the TCM term for the pupil, belonging to the water wheel and related to the kidney.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>瞳子是中医学对瞳孔的称谓，属水轮，内应于肾。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">瞳子</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">瞳子</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003413 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003413">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000577"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">Tongshen: the TCM term for the pupil and the spirit-light it harbors, regarded as the vital locus of visual function.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>瞳神是中医学对瞳孔及其内所藏神光的称谓，为视觉功能的要害部位。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">瞳神</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">瞳神</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003414 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003414">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000577"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">Tongren: the TCM term for the pupil, synonymous with tongzi.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>瞳仁是中医学对瞳孔的称谓，与瞳子同义。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">瞳仁</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">瞳仁</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003415 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003415">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000577"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">Leiqiao: the TCM term for the lacrimal punctum, the opening of the lacrimal drainage pathway on the eyelid margin.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>泪窍是中医学对泪点（泪道在睑缘的开口）的称谓，为泪液排泄通道的起始部。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">泪窍</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">泪窍</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003416 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003416">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000577"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">Leitang: the TCM term for the region of the lacrimal caruncle and lacrimal lake at the inner canthus where tears collect.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>泪堂是中医学对内眦部泪阜与泪湖部位的称谓，为泪液汇聚之处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">泪堂</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">泪堂</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003417 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003417">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000577"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/hasFMAName"/>
                <owl:hasValue>Eye</owl:hasValue>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">Muxi (ocular connector): the TCM term for the structures connecting the eyeball to the brain, corresponding to the optic nerve and visual pathway.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>目系是中医学对连系眼球与脑的结构的称谓，相当于视神经及视觉传导通路。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns4:FMAID>54448</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Ocular connector (muxi)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">目系</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://ihtsdo.org/snomedct/anatomy#11287007"/>
        <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma54448"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000034 -->

    
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003419 -->

