        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003401"/>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA6AS2</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Extremities</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>四肢</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/1810600222</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Extremities</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">四肢百骸</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://ihtsdo.org/snomedct/anatomy#102292000"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003904 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003904">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003401"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>饮食物在消化吸收排泄过程中，须通过消化道的七个要冲，即“七冲门”，意为七个冲要门户，“唇为飞门，齿为户门，会厌为吸门，胃为贲门，太仓下口为幽门，大肠小肠会为阑门，下极为魄门，故曰七冲门也”</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Seven Passages</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">七冲门</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


