        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>耳</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/1144556225</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID>52780</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Ear</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">耳中</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000025 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000025">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0001775"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000739"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000742"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000740"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000794"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000777 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003403"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000704"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000736"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000056 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000805"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>覆盖全身表面，是人体最大的器官，上连毛发、指甲，下接皮下组织</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>保护机体（屏障作用，抵御病原体、紫外线）、调节体温（散热/保温）、感知外界刺激（痛、温、触）、分泌汗液/皮脂、排泄代谢废物、合成维生素D3</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>表皮（角质层、表皮细胞）、真皮（结缔组织、弹性纤维、血管、神经）、皮下组织（脂肪组织），含汗腺、皮脂腺、毛囊</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>表皮、真皮、皮下组织；按部位分头皮、躯干皮肤、四肢皮肤等</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>湿疹、皮炎、痤疮、银屑病、白癜风、皮肤癌、真菌感染（癣）、烫伤</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>皮肤pH值（4.5-6.5）、皮肤温度（33-35℃）、皮脂分泌量</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>皮肤系统（核心器官）、免疫系统（屏障免疫）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>
        <rdfs:label>Skin</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">west:皮肤</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000031 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000031">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000030"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>十二经脉(十二正经)的络脉从本经络穴别出后，均走向相表里的经脉，即阴经别走于阳经，阳经别走于阴经。十五络脉具有沟通表里经脉之间的联系，统率浮络、孙络，灌渗气血以濡养全身的作用。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">十五别络</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">十五别络</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000032 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000032">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000030"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>浮络是络脉中浮行于浅表部位的分支。在全身络脉中，浮行于浅表部位的称为“浮络”，它分布在皮肤表面。其主要作用是输布气血以濡养全身。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">浮络</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">浮络</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000033 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000033">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000030"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>从别络分出最细小的分支称为“孙络”，它的作用同浮络一样输布气血，濡养全身。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">孙络</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">孙络</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000035 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000035">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000034"/>
        <ns4:FMAID>9726</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">sinew channel (TCM)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">经筋</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000036 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000036">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000034"/>
        <ns4:FMAID>7022</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">cutaneous region (TCM)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">皮部</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000038 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000038">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000005"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>少泽穴位于人体的小指末节尺侧，距指甲角0.1寸。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">少泽</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">少泽</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000039 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000039">
