        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">丝竹空</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000100 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000100">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000009"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>中府穴位于人体的胸外侧部，云门穴下1寸，平第一肋间隙处，距前正中线6寸。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">中府</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">中府</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000101 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000101">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000009"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>云门穴位于人体的胸外侧部，肩胛骨喙突上方，锁骨下窝凹陷处，距前正中线6寸。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">云门</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">云门</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000102 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000102">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000009"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>天府穴位于人体的臂内侧面，肱二头肌桡侧缘，腋前纹头下3寸处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">天府</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">天府</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000103 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000103">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000009"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>侠白穴位于人体的臂内侧面，肱二头肌桡侧缘，腋前纹头下4寸，或肘横纹上5寸处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">侠白</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">侠白</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000104 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000104">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000009"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>尺泽穴位于在肘横纹中，肱二头肌腱桡侧凹陷处（或手臂肘部，取穴时先将手臂上举，在手臂内侧中央处有粗腱，腱的外侧外即是此穴）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">尺泽</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">尺泽</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000105 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000105">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000009"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>伸前臂仰掌，孔最穴位于前臂部位，前臂内侧，在太渊穴与尺泽穴连线的上4/9处（前臂掌面桡侧，当尺泽穴与太渊穴连线上，腕横纹上7寸处）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">孔最</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">孔最</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000106 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000106">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000009"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>&quot;列缺穴位于手腕内侧（大拇指侧下），能感觉到脉搏跳动之处。（或在前臂桡侧缘，桡骨茎突上方，腕横纹上1.5寸，当肱桡肌与拇长展肌腱之间。）
　　[简便取穴法] 两手虎口自然乎直交叉，一手食指按在另一手桡骨茎突上，指尖下凹陷中是穴。&quot;</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">列缺</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">列缺</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000107 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000107">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000009"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>经渠穴位于人体的前臂掌面桡侧，桡骨茎突与桡动脉之间凹陷处，腕横纹上1寸。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">经渠</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">经渠</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000108 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000108">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000009"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>太渊穴位于腕掌侧横纹桡侧，桡动脉搏动处（手腕部位，手腕横纹上，拇指根部侧）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">太渊</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">太渊</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000109 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000109">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000009"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>鱼际穴位于人体的手拇指本节（第１掌指关节）后凹陷处，约当第１掌骨中点桡侧，赤白肉际处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA2JN4</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Thenar eminence</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>鱼际隆起</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/1801193064</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">鱼际</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">鱼际</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


