    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000123">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000011"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>郄门穴位于人体的前臂掌侧，当曲泽穴与大陵穴的连线上，腕横纹上５寸。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">郄门</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">郄门</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000124 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000124">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000011"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>间使穴位于人体的前臂掌侧，当曲泽穴与大陵穴的连线上，腕横纹上３寸，掌长肌腱与桡侧腕屈肌腱之间。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">间使</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">间使</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


