        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">下关</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">下关</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000203 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000203">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>此穴在头侧部发际里，位于额角发际点向上一指宽，嘴动时肌肉也会动之处（当额角发际上0.5寸，头正中线旁开4.5寸）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns4:FMAID>54908</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Touwei (ST8 acupoint)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">头维</rdfs:label>
    
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000036 xml:lang="zh-cn">头维（足阳明经）</ns6:TCM_TO_0000036>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000036 xml:lang="en">Head</ns6:TCM_TO_0000036>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh-cn">1.9.15 经三专家复核与PI裁决，由 TCM_HAO_00000000000000000409（头维（足阳明经））合并入本类，公理与映射注解已迁移。</rdfs:comment>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000026"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>在头侧部，当额角发际上0.5寸，头正中线旁开4.5寸。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035></owl:NamedIndividual>
    


