    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000228">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>阴市穴位于人体的大腿前面，当髂前上棘与髌底外侧端的连线上，髌底上3寸。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">阴市</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">阴市</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000229 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000229">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>梁丘穴位于屈膝时，大腿前面，当髂前上棘与髌底外侧端的连线上，髌底上2寸。（伸展膝盖用力时，筋肉凸出处的凹洼；从膝盖骨右端，约三个手指左右的上方也是该穴）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">梁丘</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">梁丘</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000230 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000230">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>屈膝时，犊鼻穴位于在膝部，髌骨与髌韧带外侧凹陷中。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA3H13</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Nose</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>鼻</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/1082634473</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID>54247</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dubi (ST35 acupoint)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">犊鼻</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000231 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000231">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>&quot;足三里穴位于小腿前外侧，当犊鼻穴下3寸，距胫骨前缘一横指（中指）外膝眼下四横指、胫骨边缘（找穴时左腿用右手、右腿用左手以食指第二关节沿胫骨上移，至有突出的斜面骨头阻挡为止，指尖处即为此穴）。
简易找法：从下往上触摸小腿的外侧，左膝盖的膝盖骨下面，可摸到凸块（胫骨外侧髁）。由此再往外，斜下方一点之处，还有另一凸块（腓骨小头）。这两块凸骨以线连结，以此线为底边向下作一正三角形。而此正三角形的顶点，正是足三里穴。&quot;</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">足三里</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">足三里</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000232 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000232">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>在小腿前外侧，当犊鼻下6寸，距胫骨前缘一横指（中指）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">上巨虚</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">上巨虚</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000233 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000233">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>条口穴位于人体的小腿前外侧，当犊鼻穴下8寸，距胫骨前缘一横指（中指）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA8182</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Mouth</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>口</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/1337584902</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID>56555</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Tiaokou (ST38 acupoint)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">条口</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000234 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000234">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>下巨虚穴位于人体的小腿前外侧，当犊鼻穴下9寸，距胫骨前缘一横指（中指）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">下巨虚</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">下巨虚</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000235 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000235">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>丰隆穴位于人体的小腿前外侧，当外踝尖上8寸，条口穴外，距胫骨前缘二横指（中指）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">丰隆</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">丰隆</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000236 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000236">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>应正坐平放足底或仰卧伸直下肢的取穴姿势，解溪穴位于小腿与足背交界处的横纹中央凹陷处。（或在足背与小腿交界处的横纹中央凹陷处，当足拇长伸肌腱与趾长伸肌腱之间。）</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">解溪</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">解溪</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000237 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000237">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>冲阳穴位于人体的足背最高处，当拇长伸肌腱和趾长伸肌腱之间，足背动脉搏动处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">冲阳</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">冲阳</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000238 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000238">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>陷谷穴位于人体的足背，当第2、3跖骨结合部前方凹陷处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">陷谷</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">陷谷</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000239 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000239">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>足背当第2、3跖骨结合部前方凹陷处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">内庭</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">内庭</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000240 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000240">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000014"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>取穴时，可采用正坐或仰卧的姿势，第二厉兑穴位于足第2趾末节外侧，距趾甲角0.1寸（第二趾甲根、边缘中央下方的二毫米处）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">厉兑</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">厉兑</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000241 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000241">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000015"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>瞳子髎穴位于面部，眼睛外侧一厘米处（目外眦旁，当眶外侧缘处）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">瞳子髎</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">瞳子髎</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000242 -->

