        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000015"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>触摸耳垂后面，有称为“乳突”的凸骨，从此骨下方沿后缘，触摸上方的骨头，有一浅凹。一压，即有震动感，这就是此穴。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Bones</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>骨</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/657365008</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID>12598</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Wangu (GB12 acupoint)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">完骨</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000253 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000253">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000015"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000026"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>本神穴位于人体的头部，当前发际上0.5寸，神庭穴旁开3寸，神庭穴与头维穴连线的内三分之二与外三分之一交点处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">本神</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">本神</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000254 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000254">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000015"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000026"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>阳白穴位于面部，瞳孔直上方，离眉毛上缘约１寸处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
