        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>关元穴位于下腹部，前正中线上，当脐中下3寸（从肚脐到耻骨上方画一线，将此线五等分，从肚脐往下五分之三处）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">关元</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">关元</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000349 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000349">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>石门穴位于人体的下腹部，前正中线上，当脐中下2寸。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">石门</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">石门</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000350 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000350">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>气海穴位于人体下腹部，前正中线上，当脐中下1.5寸（直线连结肚脐与耻骨上方，将其分为十等分，从肚脐3/10的位置），即为此穴。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">气海</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">气海</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000351 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000351">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>位于人体的下腹部，前正中线上，当脐中下1寸。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">阴交</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">阴交</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000352 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000352">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>神阙穴位于人体的腹中部，脐中央。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">神阙</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">神阙</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000353 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000353">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>水分穴位于人体中腹部，前正中线上，当脐中上1寸，即肚脐上一指宽处（即拇指的宽度）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">水分</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">水分</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000354 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000354">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>下脘穴位于人体的上腹部，前正中线上，当脐中上2寸。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">下脘</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">下脘</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000355 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000355">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>建里穴位于人体的上腹部，前正中线上，当脐中上3寸。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">建里</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">建里</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000356 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000356">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>中脘穴位于人体上腹部，前正中线上，当脐中上4寸，具体找法如下：胸骨下端和肚脐连接线中点即为此穴。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">中脘</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">中脘</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000357 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000357">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>上脘穴位于人体的上腹部，前正中线上，当脐中上5寸。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">上脘</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">上脘</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000358 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000358">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>巨阙穴位于上腹部，前正中线上，当脐中上6寸（腹部中部，左右肋骨相交之处，再向下二指宽即为此穴）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">巨阙</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">巨阙</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000359 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000359">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>鸠尾穴位于心窝正下方，最底下肋骨稍下处（人体鸠尾穴位于上腹部，前正中线上，当胸剑结合部下1寸）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">鸠尾</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">鸠尾</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000360 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000360">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>中庭穴位于人体的胸部，当前正中线上，平第5肋间，即胸剑结合部。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">中庭</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">中庭</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000361 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000361">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>膻中穴位于人体胸部，两乳头之间连线的中点（当前正中线上，平第4肋间）。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">膻中</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">膻中</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000362 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000362">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>玉堂穴位于人体的胸部，当前正中线上，平第3肋间。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">玉堂</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">玉堂</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000363 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000363">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>紫宫穴位于人体的胸部，当前正中线上，平第2肋间。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">紫宫</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">紫宫</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000364 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000364">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>华盖穴位于人体的胸部，当前正中线上，平第1肋间。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">华盖</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">华盖</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000365 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000365">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>璇玑穴位于人体的胸部，当前正中线上，天突穴下1寸。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">璇玑</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">璇玑</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000366 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000366">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000027"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>天突穴位于颈部，当前正中线上，两锁骨中间，胸骨上窝中央。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">天突</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">天突</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000367 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000367">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>廉泉穴位于人体的颈部，当前正中线上，结喉上方，舌骨上缘凹陷处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">廉泉</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">廉泉</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000368 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000368">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>承浆穴位于人体的面部，当颏唇沟的正中凹陷处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">承浆</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">承浆</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000369 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000369">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000023"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>长强穴位于人体的尾骨端下，当尾骨端与肛门连线的中点处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">长强</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">长强</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000370 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000370">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000023"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>腰俞穴位于骶部，当后正中线上，适对骶管裂孔，臀沟分开处即是。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns4:FMAID>50834</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Waist</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">腰俞</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000371 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000371">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000023"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>腰阳关穴位于腰部，当后正中线上，第四腰椎棘突下凹陷处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns4:FMAID>50834</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Yaoyangguan (GV3 acupoint)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">腰阳关</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000372 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000372">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000023"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>命门穴位于腰部，当后正中线上，第二腰椎棘突下凹陷处。指压时，有强烈的压痛感。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">命门</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">命门</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000373 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000373">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000023"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>悬枢穴位于人体的腰部，当后正中线上，第1腰椎棘突下凹陷中。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">悬枢</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">悬枢</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000374 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000374">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000023"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>取穴时采用俯伏坐位，脊中穴位于背部，当后正中线上，第十一胸椎棘突下凹陷处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">脊中</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">脊中</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000375 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000375">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000023"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>中枢穴位于人体的背部，当后正中线上，第10胸椎棘突下凹陷中。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">中枢</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">中枢</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000376 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000376">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000023"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>筋缩穴位于人体的背部，当后正中线上，第9胸椎棘突下凹陷中。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns4:FMAID>9726</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Jinsuo (GV8 acupoint)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">筋缩</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000377 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000377">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000023"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>至阳穴位于背部，当后正中线上，第七胸椎棘突下凹陷中。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">至阳</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">至阳</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000378 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000378">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000023"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>灵台穴位于人体的背部，当后正中线上，第6胸椎棘突下凹陷中。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">灵台</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">灵台</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000379 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000379">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000023"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>神道穴位于后背部，当后正中线上，第五、第六胸椎中央处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">神道</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">神道</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000380 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000380">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000023"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>身柱穴位于后背部，当后正中线上，第三胸椎棘突下凹陷处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">身柱</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">身柱</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000381 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000381">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000023"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>陶道穴位于颈部下端，当后正中线上，第一胸椎棘突和第二胸椎棘突之间的凹陷处。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">陶道</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">陶道</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000382 -->

