    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000668">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000034"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">经别</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000671 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000671">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000554"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000068"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000682"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000683"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000792"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000794"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000795"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000777 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000000068"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000692"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000736"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000744"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000056 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000816"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000056 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000817"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>左上腹，左季肋区，第9-11肋深面，邻胃底与左肾</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>滤过血液清除衰老血细胞、培育免疫细胞（T/B细胞）、储存血液、参与应急造血、调节机体免疫</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>红髓、白髓、脾小梁、结缔组织被膜，含淋巴细胞、巨噬细胞、血窦</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>红髓（脾索、脾血窦）、白髓（脾小结、动脉周围淋巴鞘）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>脾肿大、脾功能亢进、脾破裂、淋巴瘤</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>脾厚度3-4cm、脾长径8-12cm</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>免疫系统、造血系统</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>脾是重要的淋巴器官，位于腹腔的左上方，呈扁椭圆形，暗红色、质软而脆，当局部受暴力打击易破裂出血。脾位于左季肋区胃底与膈之间，恰与第9-11肋相对，其长轴与第10肋一致。正常情况下，左肋弓下缘不能触及。脾分为内、外两面，上、下两缘，前、后两端。内面凹陷与胃底、左肾、左肾上腺、胰尾和结肠左曲为邻，称为脏面。脏面近中央处有一条沟，是神经、血管出入之处，称脾门。外面平滑而隆凸与膈相对，称为膈面。上缘前部有2-3个切迹，称脾切迹。脾肿大时，脾切迹仍存在可作为触诊的标志。在脾附近，胃脾韧带及大网膜中，常可见到暗红色，大小不等，数目不一的副脾。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label>west:脾</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000672 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000672">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003469"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000634 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000620"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000660 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003473"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000675"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000691"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000692"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000678 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003406"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000675"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>胁下，腹腔右侧，膈下，将军之官所在，位于中焦</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>主疏泄、主藏血、其华在爪、在液为泪、开窍于目</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>主疏泄指肝调节气机、情志、饮食消化及水液代谢；主藏血指肝贮藏血液、调节血量，为肢体活动与目窍濡养提供保障</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>对应西医腹腔内的肝脏、胆囊及胆道系统、部分自主神经（调控情志与消化）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>肝气郁结、肝火上炎、肝阳上亢、肝血虚、肝阴虚、寒凝肝脉</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>&quot;肝的实体位于腹腔，横膈之下，右胁之内。
《灵枢·本藏》记述了肝的形态大小位置高下偏正质地坚脆与发病的关系。《难经·四十一难》载“肝独有两叶”，《四十二难》说：“胆在肝之短叶之间。”并记录了肝的重量与左右分叶。其后历代医家对肝的形态解剖的认识大致相同，与现代解剖学对肝的位置形态的描述基本一致。&quot;</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>肝位于右上腹，膈下右胁内。《素问·金匮真言论》：&apos;东方青色，入通于肝&apos;。肝主疏泄，主藏血，为将军之官。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA4YZ0</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Hepatic plexus</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>肝丛</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/240736650</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <rdfs:label>tcm:肝</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000673 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000673">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000435"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">涎</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000674 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000674">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000435"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">涕</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000675 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000675">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0001722"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000682"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000691"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000682"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000693"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000787"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000777 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000672"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000692"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000056 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000812"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000056 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000813"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>右上腹，膈下，肝胃韧带与肝十二指肠韧带内，大部分被肋弓覆盖</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>代谢解毒（药物/毒物）、合成蛋白质与凝血因子、储存肝糖原和维生素、分泌胆汁乳化脂肪、参与胆红素代谢</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>肝细胞、肝血窦、胆管上皮细胞、结缔组织，分肝小叶（基本功能单位）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>左叶、右叶、方叶、尾状叶；肝实质、肝内胆管系统</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>病毒性肝炎、脂肪肝、肝硬化、肝癌、肝脓肿、胆汁淤积</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>谷丙转氨酶（ALT）、谷草转氨酶（AST）、总胆红素、白蛋白、凝血酶原时间</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>消化系统（核心代谢器官）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>肝脏是人体中最大的腺体，也是最重要的器官之一。
人的肝脏大部分位于腹腔右上方，小部分在左上方，紧贴在膈肌下面。肝脏的表面覆有被膜，其结缔组织伸人肝实质内将肝分成许多小叶。肝小叶是肝脏的结构和功能单位。肝小叶呈多面棱柱体。成人的肝脏有50万—100万个肝小叶。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>解剖部位：人的肝脏大部分位于右季肋部及上腹部，小部分位于左季肋区，上界在右锁骨中线平第5肋，上部紧贴膈肌，与右肺和心脏相邻；下面与胃、十二指肠，结肠右曲相邻；后面接触右肾、肾上腺和食管贲门部，是人体最大腺体，红褐色，质软而脆，呈楔形，右端圆钝，左端扁薄，可分为上、下两面，前后两缘，左右两叶，一般重约1200～1600g，约占成人体重的1/50，男性的比女性的略重，成年人肝脏男性有1.4-1.8公斤，女性有1.2-1.4公斤。胎儿和新生儿的肝脏相对较大，可达体重的1/20。正常肝脏外观呈红褐色，质软而脆。肝脏形态呈一不规则楔形，右侧钝厚而左侧偏窄，一般左右径(长)约25cm，上下径(宽)约15cm，前后径(厚)约6cm 。上面突起浑圆，与膈肌接触，下面较扁平，与胃、十二指肠、胆囊和结肠相邻。肝上界与膈肌的位置一致，约在右侧第五肋间，肝脏有一定的活动度，可随体位的改变和呼吸而上下移动；肝下界一般不超过肋弓，正常情况下在肋缘下摸不到，有时在剑突下可触及，但一般不超过3cm，而小儿多可在肋缘下触及。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA5DY0</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Liver</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>肝脏</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/328366540</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">7197</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label>west:肝</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000676 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000676">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003469"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000634 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000622"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000660 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000572"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000664 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000679"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000679"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000687"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000694"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000678 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003403"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000679"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>主气、司呼吸、主宣发肃降、通调水道、其华在毛、在液为涕、开窍于鼻</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>胸腔，两肺分居于心之两侧，膈上，相傅之官所在，位于上焦</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>主气指肺主一身之气与呼吸之气，司呼吸维系机体与外界的气体交换；主宣发肃降调节气机与水液代谢，通调水道为“肺为水之上源”的理论基础</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>对应西医呼吸系统（肺脏、气管、支气管、鼻腔）及胸廓相关组织</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>肺气虚、肺阴虚、风寒犯肺、风热犯肺、痰湿阻肺、燥邪伤肺</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>肺位于胸腔，左右各一，覆盖于心之上。《素问·五藏生成》：&apos;诸气者，皆属于肺&apos;。肺主气司呼吸，为相傅之官。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">肺位于胸腔，左右各一，覆盖于心之上。肺有分叶，左二右三，共五叶。肺经肺系（指气管、支气管等）与喉、鼻相连，故称喉为肺之门户，鼻为肺之外窍。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data xml:lang="en">XA57M6</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN xml:lang="en">Lung</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH xml:lang="en">肺</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference xml:lang="en">http://id.who.int/icd/entity/1338477196</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">7240</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label>tcm:肺</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000679 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000679">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000505"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000667"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000822"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000784"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000794"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000822"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000698"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000056 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000679"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000056 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000827"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>胸腔内，纵隔两侧，左肺2叶（上/下），右肺3叶（上/中/下），肺尖突至锁骨内侧1/3上方</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>进行肺与外界的气体交换（氧合与排碳）、调节呼吸节律、过滤吸入气体、分泌黏液清除异物、参与酸碱平衡调节</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>肺泡上皮细胞、支气管黏膜、结缔组织、肺间质，含Ⅰ型/Ⅱ型肺泡细胞、毛细血管网</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>左肺、右肺；支气管树（主支气管、叶支气管、段支气管）、肺泡（基本功能单位）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>肺炎、支气管炎、哮喘、肺气肿、肺癌、肺结核、呼吸衰竭</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>肺活量3500ml（男）/2500ml（女）、血氧饱和度≥95%、肺通气量6-8L/min</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>呼吸系统（核心器官）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>
        <ns6:SNOMEDID rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">10024003</ns6:SNOMEDID>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>肺是人体的呼吸器官，位于胸腔，左右各一，覆盖于心之上。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>解剖结构：肺上端钝圆叫肺尖，向上经胸廓上口突入颈根部，底位于膈上面，对向肋和肋间隙的面叫肋面，朝向纵隔的面叫内侧面，该面中央的支气管、血管、淋巴管和神经出入处叫肺门，这些出入肺门的结构，被结缔组织包裹在一起叫肺根。左肺由斜裂分为上、下二个肺叶，右肺除斜裂外，还有一水平裂将其分为上、中、下三个肺叶。肺是以支气管反复分支形成的支气管树为基础构成的。
左、右支气管在肺门分成第二级支气管，第二级支气管及其分支所辖的范围构成一个肺叶，每支第二级支气管又分出第三级支气管，每支第三级支气管及其分支所辖的范围构成一个肺段，支气管在肺内反复分支可达23-25级，最后形成肺泡。支气管各级分支之间以及肺泡之间都由结缔组织性的间质所填充，血管、淋巴管、神经等随支气管的分支分布在结缔组织内。肺泡之间的间质内含有丰富的毛细血管网，毛细血管膜与肺泡共同组成呼吸膜，血液和肺泡内气体进行气体交换必须通过呼吸膜才能进行，呼吸膜面积较大，平均约70平方米，安静状态下只动用其中40平方米用于呼吸时的气体交换，是肺呼吸的重要组成。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA57M6</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Lung</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>肺</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/1338477196</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">7240</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label>west:肺</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>http://ihtsdo.org/snomedct/anatomy#10024003</rdfs:seeAlso>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000680 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000680">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003469"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000634 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000621"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000634 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000642"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000634 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000643"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000660 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000579"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000683"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000695"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000696"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000697"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000678 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000598"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000683"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>主藏精、主水、主纳气、其华在发、在液为唾、开窍于耳及二阴</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>腰部，脊柱两侧，左右各一，先天之本所在，位于下焦</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>主藏精指肾贮藏先天之精与后天之精，为生长发育与生殖提供基础；主水指肾调节体内水液代谢的全过程；主纳气指肾摄纳肺吸入的清气，维系呼吸深度</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>对应西医泌尿系统（肾脏、膀胱）、生殖系统及内分泌系统（调控生长发育）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>肾阳虚、肾阴虚、肾精不足、肾气不固、肾虚水泛</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>肾位于腰部，脊柱两侧，左右各一。《素问·脉要精微论》：&apos;腰者，肾之府&apos;。肾藏精，主水，主纳气，为先天之本。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label>tcm:肾</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000681 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000681">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000428"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000680"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000726"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000696"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000744"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000678 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000598"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000696"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000697"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>主生长发育、主生殖、主濡养脏腑形体、主化生气血津液，为人体生命活动的本源</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>藏于肾，流于五脏六腑，分为先天之精（源于父母）、后天之精（源于水谷），无固定解剖定位</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>精为先天之本，肾精充盛则生长发育正常、生殖功能健全，肾精不足则小儿发育迟缓、老人腰膝酸软、男子阳痿、女子宫寒</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>对应西医生殖系统（精子、卵子）、内分泌系统（性激素、生长激素）、骨髓组织、肾精相关代谢系统</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>肾精不足、精亏、精寒（伴腰膝酸软、头晕耳鸣、发育迟缓、生殖功能异常）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>广义的精，泛指由气而化生的构成人体和维持生命活动的精微物质；狭义的精，指肾藏之精，即生殖之精，是促进人体生长发育和生殖功能的基本物质。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">tcm：精</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000682 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000682">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0001672"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000671"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000675"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000824"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000675"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000693"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000787"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000777 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000578"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000692"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000056 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000814"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000056 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000815"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>左上腹，膈下，胃底邻膈，胃体邻肝左叶与脾，幽门接十二指肠</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>容纳并储存食物、分泌胃液（胃酸/胃蛋白酶）初步消化蛋白质、通过蠕动将食糜排入小肠、调节胃排空速度</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>胃黏膜上皮、平滑肌层、结缔组织被膜，含壁细胞、主细胞、黏液细胞</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>胃底、胃体、胃窦、幽门部、贲门部</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>急性胃炎、慢性胃炎、胃溃疡、胃癌、胃食管反流病、幽门梗阻</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>胃液pH值1.5-3.5、胃排空时间4-6小时</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>消化系统</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>
        <rdfs:label>Stomach</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">west:胃</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000683 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000683">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0002786"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000778"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000779"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000778"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000779"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000777 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000680"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000694"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000056 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000780"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000056 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000781"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>脊柱两侧，腹后壁，左肾平第11胸椎下缘至第2腰椎下缘，右肾略低1-2cm，上邻肾上腺，内邻肾盂/输尿管</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>生成尿液排泄代谢废物、调节水盐与酸碱平衡、分泌促红细胞生成素/肾素/维生素D3、维持血压稳定</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>肾实质（肾单位：肾小球、肾小管、集合管）、肾间质（结缔组织、血管、神经）、肾盂移行上皮组织</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>按结构分肾皮质（外层，占1/3）、肾髓质（内层，占2/3，含肾锥体）、肾盂（收集系统）；按功能分泌尿部、排尿部</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>肾小球肾炎、肾病综合征、肾衰竭、肾癌、肾盂肾炎、肾积水</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>血肌酐（Scr）、尿素氮（BUN）、尿酸（UA）、肾小球滤过率（GFR）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>泌尿系统（核心器官）、内分泌系统（旁分泌器官）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>肾脏为成对的蚕豆状器官，位于腹膜后脊柱两旁浅窝中。约长10-12厘米、宽5-6厘米、厚3-4厘米、重120-150克；左肾较右肾稍大，肾纵轴上端向内、下端向外，因此两肾上极相距较近，下极较远，肾纵轴与脊柱所成角度为30度左右。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA6KU8</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Kidney</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>肾脏</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/720032908</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">7202</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label>west:肾</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000684 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000684">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000429"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000676"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000680"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000000068"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000697"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000736"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000689"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000697"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000698"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>主推动、温煦、固摄、防御、气化，濡养全身脏腑形体官窍，维持生命活动</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>遍布全身，内藏于脏腑，外布于形体官窍，无固定解剖定位，随脉运行</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>气的生成源于先天之精、后天水谷精微与自然界清气，分为元气、宗气、营气、卫气；元气主推动生长发育，宗气主呼吸行血，营气主濡养，卫气主防御</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>对应西医全身能量代谢系统、呼吸循环系统、免疫系统、内分泌系统（无固定组织，体现中医整体观）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>气虚、气陷、气滞、气逆（伴神疲乏力、头晕、腹胀、咳嗽）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>中医学中的气是指人体内活力很强的运行不息的极其细微物质，是构成人体和维持人体生命活动的最基本物质。气运行不息，推动和调控着人体内的新陈代谢，维系着人体的生命进程。气的运动停止，则意味着生命的终止。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">tcm:气</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000686 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000686">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000009"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003403"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000660 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000572"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000661 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000676"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000698"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000704"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000702"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000703"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>属肺、络大肠，主气司呼吸，调节气血运行，联络肺与体表肌肤</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>起于中焦，下络大肠，还循胃口，上膈属肺，从肺系横出腋下，下循臑内前廉，止于拇指桡侧端，行于上肢内侧前缘</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>手阳明大肠经为大肠之经脉，联络肺与面口，调节大肠传导功能，主治便秘、泄泻、牙痛、咽喉肿痛及上肢外侧前缘循行痛</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>对应西医上肢内侧前缘皮神经、尺动脉分支、肺脏周围神经丛、鼻腔黏膜神经</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>肺经气滞、肺经风热、肺经虚寒（伴上肢麻木、鼻窍不利）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">tcm:手太阴肺经</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


