        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000757"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000000068"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000689"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000696"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000696"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000703"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>总督十二经气血、主濡养胞胎、调节脏腑气血、联络肝肾脾胃、主治月经不调/崩漏/疝气/腹痛</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>起于胞中，下出会阴，沿腹前正中线上行，至胸中而散，又沿脊柱内上行，上达头面，行于腹正中与脊柱内</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>冲脉为“十二经之海”“血海”，与任脉同起于胞中，为气血运行之要冲，调节全身气血分布，与女子月经、胎孕密切相关，男子主调节肝肾气血</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>对应西医腹前正中神经、脊柱内脊神经、盆腔生殖系统神经、肝肾脾胃周围神经丛、全身血管舒缩神经</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>冲脉气滞、冲脉亏虚、冲脉瘀阻、冲气上逆（伴月经不调、腹痛、呃逆）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">tcm:冲脉</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000753 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000753">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003407"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000634 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000000068"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000644"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000664 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000692"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000747"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000754"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000831 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003404"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>主纳饮食、主辨五味、反映脾胃气血盛衰、联络脾胃与舌、依赖脾津濡养</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>位于面部中央，上连鼻腔，下接咽喉，内通脾胃，包括口唇、口腔，口唇为脾之华</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>口为脾之窍，脾胃气血充盛则口唇淡红、口味正常，脾虚则口唇淡白、口淡无味，脾热则口唇红赤、口干口苦</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>对应西医口腔组织、口唇、味蕾、胃肠壁神经、唾液腺</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>口淡、口苦、口干、口唇淡白/红赤、口角流涎（伴腹胀、便溏）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">tcm:口</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000754 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000754">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0001651"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">west:唾液腺</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000755 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000755">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000434"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000672"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003445"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000000068"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000664 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000744"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000678 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003405"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000689"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000744"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>主濡养全身脏腑形体官窍、主运载气血津液、主藏神，维持肢体活动与神志清晰</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>行于脉中，内藏于肝，统于脾，源于心，濡养全身，与脉密不可分</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>血的生成源于水谷精微与肾精，心主行血、肝主藏血、脾主统血；血充盛则形体健、神志清，血虚则肢体麻木、失眠健忘</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>对应西医全身血液系统（红细胞、血浆）、血液循环系统、造血系统</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>血虚、血瘀、血热、血寒（伴面色苍白、头晕、肢体麻木、瘀斑）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">tcm:血</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000756 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000756">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000435"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000657"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000676"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000000068"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000692"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000694"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000692"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000694"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>主濡养滋润全身脏腑形体官窍、主参与水液代谢、主化生血液，维持机体水液平衡</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>遍布全身，清稀者为津，稠厚者为液；津布于体表，液藏于脏腑，无固定解剖定位</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>津液的生成源于水谷精微，肺主通调、脾主运化、肾主气化、三焦主通行；津亏则皮干、口干，液耗则骨痿、目涩</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>对应西医全身体液系统（组织液、淋巴液）、泌尿系统、水液代谢系统</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>津亏、液耗、水湿内停、痰饮（伴口干、皮干、腹胀、水肿）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">tcm:津液</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


