        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000701"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>椎管内，上接延髓，下至第1-2腰椎下缘，分为颈髓、胸髓、腰髓、骶髓、尾髓</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>传导大脑与躯体/内脏的神经信号、完成简单反射（膝跳反射、排尿反射）、整合躯体感觉与运动指令</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>神经组织（神经元、神经纤维）、神经胶质细胞、血管，中央为灰质（蝴蝶形）、周围为白质</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>按节段分颈髓8节、胸髓12节、腰髓5节、骶髓5节、尾髓1节；结构上分灰质、白质、脊髓膜</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>脊髓损伤、脊髓炎、脊髓肿瘤、腰椎间盘突出压迫脊髓、脊髓空洞症</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>脊髓诱发电位、脑脊液常规</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>神经系统（中枢组成部分）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>
        <rdfs:label>SpinalCord</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">west:脊髓</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000786 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000786">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000212"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000822"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000823"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000784"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000794"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000697"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>颈前部，喉与气管前方，分为左右两叶、峡部连接，上邻甲状软骨，下接气管上段</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>分泌甲状腺激素（T3、T4），调节新陈代谢、促进生长发育、维持体温稳定、影响神经系统兴奋性</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>左叶、右叶、峡部；按功能分滤泡上皮细胞（分泌T3、T4）、滤泡旁细胞（分泌降钙素）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>甲状腺功能亢进（甲亢）、甲状腺功能减退（甲减）、甲状腺结节、甲状腺炎、甲状腺癌</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>T3、T4、TSH（促甲状腺激素）、甲状腺超声大小</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>内分泌系统（核心分泌器官）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>甲状腺滤泡上皮细胞、滤泡旁细胞（C细胞）、结缔组织、血管与神经，滤泡内储存甲状腺球蛋白</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>
        <rdfs:label>Thyroid Gland</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">west:甲状腺</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000787 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000787">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000219"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000675"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000682"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000693"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000675"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000794"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000692"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000697"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>上腹部，胃后方，横卧于腹后壁，胰头邻十二指肠，胰尾邻脾，内分泌部分为胰岛，散在于胰腺实质内</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>分泌胰岛素（降血糖）、胰高血糖素（升血糖）、生长抑素（调节激素分泌），维持血糖稳态</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>胰岛细胞（A细胞、B细胞、D细胞）、结缔组织、血管，B细胞占胰岛细胞的70%-80%（分泌胰岛素）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>胰岛（内分泌部分）、胰腺实质（外分泌部分，补充说明）；胰岛细胞分A细胞、B细胞、D细胞</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>糖尿病（1型/2型）、胰岛细胞瘤、胰腺神经内分泌肿瘤</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>空腹血糖3.9-6.1mmol/L、餐后2小时血糖＜7.8mmol/L、胰岛素、C肽</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>内分泌系统、消化系统（外分泌部分）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>
        <rdfs:label>Pancreas</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">west:胰腺</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000788 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000788">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0002838"/>
