        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000056 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000811"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>循环于心脏与全身血管内，遍布全身，占人体体重的7%-8%</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>输送氧气与营养物质至全身组织、排出二氧化碳与代谢废物、运输激素与免疫细胞、调节体温与酸碱平衡、参与止血与凝血</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>血浆（水、蛋白质、电解质、激素、代谢废物）、血细胞（红细胞、白细胞、血小板）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>血浆（占55%）、血细胞（占45%）；血细胞分红细胞、白细胞（粒细胞、淋巴细胞）、血小板</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>贫血、白血病、血小板减少症、血友病、败血症、血栓形成</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>血红蛋白（男120-160g/L、女110-150g/L）、白细胞计数（4-10×10⁹/L）、血小板计数（100-300×10⁹/L）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>血液系统、循环系统（核心组成）、免疫系统（免疫细胞载体）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>
        <rdfs:label>Blood</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">west:血液</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000795 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000795">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000049"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000792"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000793"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000794"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000671"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000792"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000793"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000777 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000433"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000736"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000744"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>存在于血液、淋巴结、胸腺、脾脏、淋巴液中，遍布全身免疫器官与组织</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>识别并清除病原体（病毒、细菌）、产生抗体（B细胞）、杀伤异常细胞（T细胞）、记忆免疫信息</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>淋巴细胞胞体、细胞质、细胞核，分为T淋巴细胞、B淋巴细胞、NK细胞（自然杀伤细胞）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>T淋巴细胞（辅助T细胞、细胞毒性T细胞）、B淋巴细胞、NK细胞</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>淋巴细胞减少症、淋巴细胞增多症、淋巴瘤、艾滋病（破坏T细胞）、免疫缺陷病</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>淋巴细胞比例（20%-40%）、T细胞亚群计数、B细胞计数</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>血液系统、免疫系统（核心免疫细胞）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>
        <rdfs:label>Lymphocyte</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">west:淋巴细胞</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000796 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000796">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0001289"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000667"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000662 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000739"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000667"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000683"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000663 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000794"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000777 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003405"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000055 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000689"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>遍布全身，与心脏相连，分动脉、静脉、毛细血管，动脉走行较深，静脉部分浅在</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>输送血液至全身组织、调节血管口径控制血压、物质交换（毛细血管）、参与体循环与肺循环</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000677>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>动脉（弹性纤维、平滑肌）、静脉（结缔组织、平滑肌）、毛细血管（单层内皮细胞）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000772>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>动脉（大动脉、中动脉、小动脉）、静脉（大静脉、中静脉、小静脉）、毛细血管</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000773>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>动脉硬化、高血压、静脉血栓、动脉瘤、血管炎</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000774>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>动脉血压、静脉压、血流速度</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000775>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>循环系统</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000776>
        <rdfs:label>Blood Vessel</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">west:血管</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


