    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003470 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003470">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003469"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>心脏外面的包膜， 有保护心脏的作用。
心包络，简称心包，是心脏外面的包膜，为心脏的外围组织，其上附有脉络，是通行气血的经络，合称心包络。由于心包络是心的外围组织，故有保护心脏，代心受邪的作用。脏象学说认为，心为君主之官，邪不能犯，所以外邪侵袭于心时，首先侵犯心包络，故曰“诸邪之在于心者，皆在于心之包络”</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns4:FMAID>7088</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Heart</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">心包络（心包）</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003473 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003473">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003472"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003474"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000635 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000620"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000660 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000672"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000675"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000691"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000693"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000691"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>藏胆汁、主决断、协助脾胃运化饮食水谷</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>胆藏清净之胆汁，不直接参与消化但能排泄胆汁以助脾胃运化；主决断指胆调节情志，维系机体判断与应变能力，为“六腑”中唯一兼具“藏”与“泻”特性的脏腑</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>对应西医腹腔内的胆囊及胆道系统（胆总管、肝总管）</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>胁下，附于肝之短叶间，中正之官所在，位于中焦</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>胆气不足、肝胆湿热、胆郁痰扰</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>&quot;胆位于右胁下， 附于肝之短叶间， 其形如襄， 又称 ＂胆囊“。
胆居六腑之首，又隶属于奇恒之府，其形呈囊状，若悬瓠，附于肝之短叶间。胆属阳属木，与肝相表里，肝为脏属阴木，胆为腑属阳木。胆贮藏排泄胆汁，主决断，调节脏腑气。&quot;</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000036>中清之府</ns6:TCM_TO_0000036>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000036>中精之府</ns6:TCM_TO_0000036>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000036>清净之府</ns6:TCM_TO_0000036>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA0KT3</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Biliary tract</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>胆道</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/1202131133</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID>7207</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">gallbladder (TCM)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">tcm:胆</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003475 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003475">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003474"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>髓分骨髓、脊髓和脑箭，皆由肾精化生。肾精的盛衰，不仅影响骨骼的发育，而且也影 响脊简及脑髓的充盈。脊髓上通于脑，脑由髓聚而成，故《灵枢· 海论》说： ＂脑为髓之海。”《素问．五藏生成》说：“诸髓者，皆属于脑。”</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>髓是骨腔中的一种膏样物质，为脑髓脊髓和骨髓的合称。髓由先天之精所化生，由后天之精所充养，有养脑，充骨，化血之功。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns5:ICD11ID_data>XA9XK1</ns5:ICD11ID_data>
        <ns5:ICD11NameEN>Bone marrow</ns5:ICD11NameEN>
        <ns5:ICD11NameZH>骨髓</ns5:ICD11NameZH>
        <ns5:ICD11Reference>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/1086407971</ns5:ICD11Reference>
        <ns4:FMAID>8361</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">marrow (TCM)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">tcm:髓</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003476 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003476">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003474"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>主月经</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>孕育胎儿</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>女子胞， 又称胞宫、 子宫、 子脏、 胞脏、 子处、 血脏， 位千小腹中央部， 在膀胱之后、 直肠之前， 呈倒置的梨形， 其下口（即胞门， 又称子门）与阴道相连， 其上部左右两侧有两歧， 即左右两侧的输卵管， 为女性生殖器官。 女子胞， 是女性的内生殖器官， 有主月经和孕育胎儿的作用。
女子胞，又称胞宫子宫子脏胞脏子处血脏，位于小腹正中部，是女性的内生殖器官，有主持月经和孕育胎儿的作用。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns4:FMAID>7564</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Uterus</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">tcm:女子胞</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003905 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003905">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003904"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>飞门为七冲门之一。出《难经·四十四难》。指口唇。飞，古与扉通，扉即门扇。形容口唇的张合如门扇，饮食由此而入。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns4:FMAID>59612</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Lips</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">飞门</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003906 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003906">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003904"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>&quot;户门为七冲门之一。古人谓消化系统有七个要冲，齿牙如门户，称为户门。《难经·四十四难》：“唇为飞门，齿为户门。”
户门指牙齿。食物在口内首先要通过牙齿的咀嚼，如门户一样。&quot;</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns4:FMAID>55636</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Teeth</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">户门</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003907 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003907">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003904"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>&quot;户门为七冲门之一。古人谓消化系统有七个要冲，齿牙如门户，称为户门。《难经·四十四难》：“唇为飞门，齿为户门。”
户门指牙齿。食物在口内首先要通过牙齿的咀嚼，如门户一样。&quot;</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns4:FMAID>55701</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ximen (TCM)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">吸门</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003908 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003908">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003904"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>阑门为七冲门之一。《难经·四十四难》：“大肠、小肠会为阑门。”指大、小肠交界部位。形容此处如门户间的门阑。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns4:FMAID>7210</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Ileocecal Valve</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">阑门</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003909 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003909">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003904"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>&quot;魄门指肛门。出《难经·四十四难》。
魄门又称肛门。《黄帝内经素问·五脏别论》：“魄门亦为五脏使。”魄为粕之通假字，魄门即粕门。饮食糟粕由此排出体外，故称。魄门的开合由心神支配，又与前阴同为肾之开窍，饮食糟粕的排出与脾的运化、肺的肃降、以至肝的疏泄作用均有密切关系，而魄门把浊物糟粕排出体外，亦有利于五脏的正常气化活动。&quot;</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns4:FMAID>7152</ns4:FMAID>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Pomen (anal sphincter, TCM)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">魄门</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000000068 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000000068">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003469"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000634 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000644"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000660 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000578"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000675"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000682"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000693"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000665 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003450"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000678 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003404"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000682"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000688 rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000787"/>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>主运化（运化水谷、运化水湿）、主升清、主统血、其华在唇、在液为涎</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000421>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>中焦，腹腔上部，膈下胃脘左侧，后天之本所在</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000658>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>主运化是脾的核心功能，运化水谷转化饮食精微为气血津液，运化水湿调节体内水液代谢；主升清指将精微物质上输于心肺，主统血指固摄血液不溢出脉外</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000659>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>对应西医消化系统（胃、小肠、肝脏、胰腺）及水液代谢相关组织</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000685>
        <ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>脾虚湿盛、脾气虚、脾阳虚、脾不统血、中气下陷</ns6:TCM_HAO_00000000000000000690>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">The individual spleen as used in cross-terminology correspondence relations: one of the five zang organs in TCM, attributed to earth and located in the middle jiao; it governs transformation and transportation of food essence and water-dampness, contains the blood, and raises the clear, and is regarded as the postnatal source of qi and blood; its correspondence extent covers the anatomical spleen and pancreas.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>中医五脏之一，属土，居中焦。主运化水谷精微与水湿，主统血，主升清，为气血生化之源、后天之本；在体合肉、开窍于口、其华在唇。其在跨体系对应关系中的外延涵盖现代解剖学的脾与胰。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh-cn">1.9.9由类IRI TCM_HAO_0000068 拆分出的个体标识(punning治理), 1.9.10补双语定义</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Spleen (TCM)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">脾</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0000068"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000001345 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000001345">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003223"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">The potential space between the visceral and parietal layers of the serous pericardium, containing a thin film of serous fluid that lubricates the heart and reduces friction during cardiac motion.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>心包脏层与壁层之间的潜在性腔隙，内含少量浆液，可减少心脏搏动时的摩擦，起润滑与保护作用。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh-cn">1.9.9由类IRI TCM_HAO_0001345 拆分出的个体标识(punning治理), 1.9.10补双语定义</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Pericardial cavity</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">心包腔</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0001345"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000001674 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000001674">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003904"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">The orifice at the junction of the oesophagus and the stomach, at the level of the lower oesophageal sphincter, preventing reflux of gastric contents into the oesophagus.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>食管与胃相接的入口部位，位于食管下括约肌水平，可防止胃内容物反流入食管。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh-cn">1.9.9由类IRI TCM_HAO_0001674 拆分出的个体标识(punning治理), 1.9.10补双语定义</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Cardia</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">贲门</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0001674"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000003400 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_900000000000000003400">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_00000000000000000022"/>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035 xml:lang="en">The soft-tissue region closing the pelvic outlet, bounded by the ischial tuberosities, pubic symphysis and coccyx; clinically divided by the inter-ischial line into the anterior urogenital triangle and the posterior anal triangle.</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>封闭骨盆下口的全部软组织区域，位于两坐骨结节与耻骨联合、尾骨之间，临床上以两坐骨结节连线分为前方的尿生殖三角与后方的肛门三角。</ns6:TCM_TO_0000035>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh-cn">1.9.9由类IRI TCM_HAO_0003400 拆分出的个体标识(punning治理), 1.9.10补双语定义</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Perineum</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">会阴</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/TCM_HAO_0003400"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


